Package: irda-utils
Version: 0.9.16-r0
Description: Provides common files needed to use IrDA. IrDA allows communication over Infrared with other devices such as phones and laptops.
Section: base
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OpenEmbedded Team <oe@handhelds.org>
Architecture: armv5te
Source: http://aleron.dl.sourceforge.net/sourceforge/irda/irda-utils-0.9.16.tar.gz 	   file://configure.patch;patch=1 	   file://m4.patch;patch=1
Depends: libgcc1 (>= 3.4.1), libc6 (>= 2.3.2+cvs20040726)
